    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "Cooking & Food",
      "content": "Heat transfer: 3 methods — conduction (contact), convection (fluid flow), radiation (heat source). Water boil 100°C, oil fry 160-190°C golden brown, air fry 200°C fast, oven 180-220°C general.",
